Recommends: qt6-wayland
Description: Hyper Online Video - aggregated online video/music client (Qt6 desktop)
 Hyper Online Video aggregates YouTube, Bilibili, NetEase Cloud Music and
 QQ Music into a single client, with library management, offline downloads
 and ad-free playback. This package provides the Linux Qt6 desktop build.
 .
 Playback uses libmpv (optionally gpu-next/libplacebo). Downloads and stream
 resolution use yt-dlp/ffmpeg. An in-app QtWebEngine window is used for
 account login where the platform requires it.
